c"},{"t":1,"s":"The `username` is a Ombrevix Ombrevix API key and the `password` is `x`. Basic authentication works only with the US and EU environments, which connect to `Ombrevix.com` directly. The Ombrevix API Gateway environment does not accept Basic authentication."}]},"o":0},{"t":10,"i":129,"p":{"k":["type","scheme","bearerFormat","description"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"http"},{"t":1,"s":"bearer"},{"t":1,"s":"JWT"},{"t":1,"s":"A Ombrevix API Gateway connector token — the only authentication the gateway accepts. Use it with the Ombrevix API Gateway environment. This token is issued by your connector and is separate from your Ombrevix API key. Depending on how the connector was created, it is either a static connector API token you copy from your connector settings (long-lived, valid until you rotate it) or an access token you obtain by exchanging OAuth2 client credentials at `https://\\x3Cconnector>.api.ombrevix.example/oauth/token`."}]},"o":0}]},"o":0},{"t":10,"i":130,"p":{"k":["Credit-Note","Credit-Note-Status","Invoice-Seller","Invoice-Customer","Invoice-Address","Credit-Note-Line-Item","Invoice-Discount","Invoice-Tax","Credit-Note-Application","Invoice-Refund","Origin-Invoice","Tax-Source-Type","Invoice-Tax-Breakout","Invoice-Tax-Addon-Breakout","Invoice-Discount-Source-Type","Invoice-Discount-Type","Invoice-Discount-Breakout"],"v":[{"t":10,"i":131,"p":{"k":["title","type","properties"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"Credit Note"},{"t":1,"s":"object"},{"t":10,"i":132,"p":{"k":["uid","workspace_id","customer_id","subscription_id","number","sequence_number","issue_date","applied_date","status","currency","memo","seller","customer","billing_address","shipping_address","subtotal_amount","discount_amount","tax_amount","total_amount","applied_amount","remaining_amount","line_items","discounts","taxes","applications","refunds","origin_invoices"],"v":[{"t":10,"i":133,"p":{"k":["type","description"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"string"},{"t":1,"s":"Unique identifier for the credit note. It is genera